                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Translation of law No. 641; November 14,
                    1899.</hi></head>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article</hi> 45.</p>
                <p>The use of trade-marks written wholly or partly in a foreign language is
                    forbidden to national factories, in the terms of law No. 452 of November 3,
                    1897.</p>
                <p>The importation of goods made abroad which carry labels wholly or partly in
                    Portuguese, except when imported from Portugal or when made for factories, is
                    forbidden.</p>
                <p rendition="#center">* * * * * * *</p>
